 },
 "inputs": [
  {
   "type": "spo:PortBinding",
   "binds_port": {
    "type": "spo:PortDefinition",
    "port_name": "reference",
    "port_direction": "input"
   },
   "bound_to": {
    "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
    "title": {
     "zh": "参考值（逐字抄录，待比较记录）",
     "en": "Reference values (transcribed verbatim; awaiting a comparison record)"
    },
    "comment": [
     "★★这**不是**《Progress of JINTRAC Deployment on the ASIPP Cluster》里的 case02 —— 那是 JET #58894（作业 101612），这是 ITER 作业 102530，两条轨迹逐点比过、对不上，是另一次运行。所以这一档的参考不来自那份 PDF，来自运行目录自己的 IDS。★W_th 抄的是 `summary.h5` 自己报的 `energy_thermal`；它和「拿 ne(Te+Ti) 积分」不是一个数（t1 处 48.769 对 50.188 MJ，差 +2.9 %），因为积分那种算法拿 ne 当离子密度、而 Zeff > 1 时离子少于电子。两个数都对，问的不是同一件事——比较时必须两边用同一种算法。★summary 的时间基和 core_profiles 的不同：t0 这一行的 W_th 落在 summary 自己最近的 83.4167 s，不是 83.5067 s，照抄不挪。",
     "| time | Te(0) | Ti(0) | ne(0) | Ip | q95 | W_th (summary.h5 energy_thermal) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 83.5067 s | 7.052 keV | 5.760 keV | 5.726e19 m^-3 | 15.00 MA | 3.146 | 42.508 MJ @ 83.4167 s |\n| 99.8267 s | 6.683 keV | 5.712 keV | 6.660e19 m^-3 | 15.00 MA | 3.232 | 48.769 MJ |\n| predicted_by_the_reference | ['current', 'electron temperature'] |\n| imposed_on_the_reference | ['ion temperature', 'electron density', 'q (initial)'] |"
    ]
   }
  }
 ],
 "caveat": {
  "zh": [
   "TGLF 湍流闭包（`closure = 3`）：参考侧的反常输运由 TGLF 按本地状态算（`jetto.jset` 的 `TransportStdPanel.anomDriftModel : TGLF`），本仓这一档只有常数 chi",
   "★`fylite cases --plan` **报不出**的那一条：把某一道**钉在给定时序上**的规定道模式。参考侧的 T_i / n_e 就是这么来的，而本仓没有这个模式，也没有对应的页面控件——所以 `--plan` 的缺口报告在这一档是**下界**。",
   "★更正（2026-08-28）：此条原写「参考按 DTSAW = 0.1 s 打锯齿」——查运行自己的配置，**锯齿模型关着**（`SawteethPanel.select : false`、`ISAW = 0`，DTSAW 是没被读的缺省）。锯齿周期机制（T-C28）已沉进内核并各自设门，但**这一档应当关着锯齿跑**，镜像参考。内半功率亏空的搬运者待定（电子能道无 v 叶子；候选 QLKNN 带 / NTM 模块 / 平衡分析敏感度），见笔记 §8d。",
   "**规定道（prescribed channel）**：参考侧只解「电流 + 电子温度」两条方程，离子温度与离子密度的方程都没选（`EquationsPanel.ionTemp.select : false` / `ionDens[*].select : false`），Ti 与 ne 由 ex-file 给定（`jetto.in` 的 `IEXTE/IEXTI/IEXNE/IEXQ = 1`）。★本仓没有「把某一道钉在给定时序上」的模式 —— 所以本仓的 Ti 是**预测**，参考的 Ti 是**输入**，这两个数不是同一类东西",
   "PENCIL 束沉积执行器（`NBIPanel.source : Pencil`，1 MeV 氘束、单 PINI、参考功率 18 MW）：参考的 14.4 / 1.91 MW 电子—离子分配是沉积算出来的结果，本仓只有一个规定的高斯源",
   "SANCO 杂质输运与辐射：参考侧铍杂质由 SANCO 输运并算辐射（t0 辐射 −5.25 MW），本仓只有规定浓度的单一杂质",
   "密度反馈控制（`jetto.in` 的 `IPFB = 2` 配 `DNEPFB` 目标序列）：参考的 ne 抬升有一部分来自加料反馈，本仓没有这个控制器"
  ],
  "en": [
   "The TGLF turbulent closure (`closure = 3`): the reference's anomalous transport is TGLF's (`jetto.jset`: `TransportStdPanel.anomDriftModel : TGLF`); this repository has a constant chi on this tier",
   "★The one `fylite cases --plan` CANNOT report: a prescribed-channel mode that PINS a channel to a given time trace. That is where the reference's T_i / n_e come from; this repository has no such mode and no control for one, so `--plan`'s gap report is a LOWER BOUND here.",
   "★CORRECTED (2026-08-28): this entry used to say the reference sawteeth on DTSAW = 0.1 s. The run's own configuration has the sawtooth model OFF (`SawteethPanel.select : false`, `ISAW = 0`; DTSAW is an unread namelist default). The period mechanism (T-C28) is sunk and gated on its own fixture, but THIS case runs with the sawtooth off, mirroring the reference. The inner power deficit's carrier is undetermined (no `v` leaf on the electron energy channel; candidates: the QLKNN band, the NTM module, the balance analysis's own sensitivity) — note §8d.",
   "A PRESCRIBED CHANNEL. The reference solves two equations only -- current and electron temperature. The ion-temperature and ion-density equations are NOT selected (`EquationsPanel.ionTemp.select : false`, `ionDens[*].select : false`), and Ti and ne come from the ex-file (`jetto.in`: `IEXTE/IEXTI/IEXNE/IEXQ = 1`). ★This repository has no mode that PINS a channel to a given time trace -- so its Ti is a PREDICTION and the reference's Ti is an INPUT, and those two numbers are not the same kind of thing",
   "The PENCIL beam-deposition executor (`NBIPanel.source : Pencil`, a 1 MeV deuterium beam, one PINI, 18 MW reference power): the reference's 14.4 / 1.91 MW electron-ion split is a RESULT of that deposition; this repository has one prescribed Gaussian source",
   "SANCO impurity transport and radiation: the reference transports beryllium with SANCO and computes its radiation (-5.25 MW at t0); this repository carries one impurity at a PRESCRIBED concentration",
   "The density feedback controller (`jetto.in`: `IPFB = 2` with a `DNEPFB` target series): part of the reference's ne rise comes from fuelling feedback, and this repository has no such controller"
  ]
 },
 "generated_by_process": {
