     "en": "The JINTRAC run directory `fydoc/third_party/data/run15MA_TBM_13_imas2_0821_repeat_102530` (ITER, job 102530; JETTO + SANCO + PENCIL, IMAS flat-HDF5 output). Every number is read from that run's OWN IDSs and its `jetto.in` / `jetto.jset`; none of it is read off a plot."
    }
   }
  ]
 },
